  "tags": [],
  "statement": "```\nemployees\n```\n\nA company plans to provide its employees with a bonus.\n\nWrite a solution to create a new column name `bonus` that contains the **doubled values** of the `salary` column.\n\nThe result format is in the following example.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput:\nDataFrame employees\n+---------+--------+\n| name    | salary |\n+---------+--------+\n| Piper   | 4548   |\n| Grace   | 28150  |\n| Georgia | 1103   |\n| Willow  | 6593   |\n| Finn    | 74576  |\n| Thomas  | 24433  |\n+---------+--------+\nOutput:\n+---------+--------+--------+\n| name    | salary | bonus  |\n+---------+--------+--------+\n| Piper   | 4548   | 9096   |\n| Grace   | 28150  | 56300  |\n| Georgia | 1103   | 2206   |\n| Willow  | 6593   | 13186  |\n| Finn    | 74576  | 149152 |\n| Thomas  | 24433  | 48866  |\n+---------+--------+--------+\nExplanation: \nA new column bonus is created by doubling the value in the column salary.\n```",
  "constraints": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "input": "DataFrame employees\n+---------+--------+\n| name    | salary |\n+---------+--------+\n| Piper   | 4548   |\n| Grace   | 28150  |\n| Georgia | 1103   |\n| Willow  | 6593   |\n| Finn    | 74576  |\n| Thomas  | 24433  |\n+---------+--------+",
      "output": "+---------+--------+--------+\n| name    | salary | bonus  |\n+---------+--------+--------+\n| Piper   | 4548   | 9096   |\n| Grace   | 28150  | 56300  |\n| Georgia | 1103   | 2206   |\n| Willow  | 6593   | 13186  |\n| Finn    | 74576  | 149152 |\n| Thomas  | 24433  | 48866  |\n+---------+--------+--------+",
      "explanation": "A new column bonus is created by doubling the value in the column salary."
    }
  ],
